\[ E_{\text{H}_2} = 0.0 - \frac{RT}{2F} \ln \left( \frac{P_{\text{H}_2}}{1} \right) \]
For the copper half-reaction, the Nernst equation is:
\[ E_{\text{Cu}^+} = 0.34 - \frac{RT}{2F} \ln \left( \frac{1}{0.1} \right) \]

