Distance per minute = $90 \times 55 = 4950$ cm per minute.
Time to reach the destination = $\frac{104,000}{4950} = \frac{104,000}{4950} = \frac{10400}{495} = \frac{2080}{99} \approx 21.02 \text{minutes}$.

