   - The line \( L' \) intersects \( C \) at \( P_1, P_3, P_6, P_7 \).
   - The homovolution \( \sigma_1 \) is defined by \( \sigma_1(P_1) = P_1 \), \( \sigma_1(P_2) = P_4 \), \( \sigma_1(P_4) = P_2 \), \( \sigma_1(P_5) = P_6 \), \( \sigma_1(P_6) = P_5 \), \( \sigma_1(P_3) = P_7 \), \( \sigma_1(P_7) = P_3 \).
