\[ f'(0) = \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{f(0 + h) - f(0)}{h} = \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{h \tan^{-1}\left(\frac{1}{h}\right) - 1}{h} = \lim_{h \to 0} \left( \tan^{-1}\left(\frac{1}{h}\right) - \frac{1}{h} \right). \]
