<start_of_turn>model
","The arithmetic sequence is given by $a_n = a_1 + (n-1)d$, where $a_1 = 19$ and $d$ is the common difference. 

For $n \geq 6$, the terms are negative, so $a_n < 0$. 

The 6th term is $a_6 = 19 + (6-1)d = 19 + 5d$. 
