The range of outcomes of measurements of the Σ⁺ rest energy would be:

\[
E_{\text{range}} = E_{\text{rest}} \pm \Delta E = 1385 \text{ MeV} \pm 9.8 \text{ MeV}
\]

Thus, the expected range of outcomes is:

