\[
\text{Decay Length} = \frac{1 \times 10^{-6} \text{ m}}{2\pi (0.3)} = \frac{1 \times 10^{-6}}{1.885} \text{ m} \approx 5.3 \times 10^{-7} \text{ m}
\]
Thus, the decay length is \(\boxed{530 \text{ nm}}\).",fluency,"# Task Description
