- \(a = 6378.131 \times 10^3 \, \text{m}\)
- \(R = 6362.121 \times 10^3 \, \text{m}\)

**Step 2: Calculate \(g_n\)**:
\[
g_n = \frac{G M}{a^2} \left(1 + \frac{R^2}{a^2}\right)^{2/3}
\]
\[
g_n = \frac{(6.67430 \times 10^{-11})(5.9761 \times 10^{24})}{(6378.131 \times 10^3)^2} \left(1 + \frac{(6362.121 \times 10^3)^2}{(6378.131 \times 10^3)^2}\right)^{2/3}
